* Ambiguity fixture (feature 26): CALLER calls CALLNAT 'DUP', which has two
* definitions (one/DUP.NSN and two/DUP.NSN) in a flat namespace (no library
* map). The resolver marks the reference Ambiguous, and the server emits a
* build-end Warning window/logMessage summarizing the count.
DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 X (A5)
END-DEFINE
CALLNAT 'DUP'
END
